### PHASE 5 — BILLING, SUBSCRIPTIONS & FREE TIER EARNINGS
###
### Tests user accounts, tokens, subscriptions, and free tier earning.
### All free tier tests use "mock": true equivalent (no real charges).
### =====================================================================

### --- USER MANAGEMENT ---

### 70. Register a new user account
